{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/e7e801cea60438b9ee572adca7d299eb.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inheriting the classic strategic gameplay from the golden era of Japanese tactical RPGs, you will personally command diverse military units that were active on European battlefields in the 18th and 19th centuries, including line infantry, skirmishers, cavalry, and artillery. Master the rock-paper-scissors of unit type advantages, leverage terrain to your benefit, and adapt to dynamic environmental changes like rainstorms, heavy snow, fog, and night\u2014conditions that can alter the fate of your entire army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/5abbb14099ad5ddef8136fc927c9b647.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An era of revolution breeds heroes: talented and reliable generals, members of secret organizations serving the crown, and musicians with extraordinary gifts... The game features over 30 beautifully illustrated characters from diverse backgrounds. The unique anime-inspired art style creates a striking contrast with the rich historical setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/c61fb39f66498376beec60a24cba7358.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/bcdb0e567781af2d6b9b7bc7b7b104e3.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this turbulent period of the French Revolution, factions like the Royalists, the Feuillants, the Jacobins, and the Malmason circle vie for power in Paris. Based at the &quot;Malmason Salon,&quot; Pauline Bonaparte finds herself at the heart of political turmoil. She must engage with all factions in Paris, completing their entrusted missions and challenges, building connections with royalty and key political figures to earn their support, and securing funds to improve weaponry and supplies. Simultaneously, she must uncover the secrets of The Maid hidden deep within the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/e6dfac047445597a6878f56e51d5bcbb.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit commanders with diverse abilities. Each character boasts unique skills, growth potential, and personal stories waiting to be unlocked. By learning their pasts, you can grant them passive bonuses, customize their equipment, and nurture them through rich promotion paths into legendary commanders capable of turning the tide of battle. Assemble a steel legion that perfectly matches your tactical style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/a16e750973800686a446fbb00117ad44.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a pure, hardcore SRPG gameplay experience. Freely combine skills and unit types, master the advantages of unit matchups and terrain, and devise strategies on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 beautifully illustrated characters, each with distinct personalities and faction allegiances, make their appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the political landscape between major factions like the Royalists and the Jacobins. Complete their requests to earn prestige, funds, and rare military equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your commanders' skills, unlock the personal stories behind each character, and forge your steel legion through a deep, varied class promotion system.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"49d1c0b896476db3f3d30eaea0fd338f4ac65fa1.jpg","localized_name":"Promoted","name":"Promoted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/49d1c0b896476db3f3d30eaea0fd338f4ac65fa1.jpg"},{"icon":"ba596879c0dc81244fc1927ff9d2983d185583db.jpg","localized_name":"\u00e9cole Militaire","name":"\u00e9cole Militaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/ba596879c0dc81244fc1927ff9d2983d185583db.jpg"},{"icon":"17b31c6806dfada4119416937469c9dc30786538.jpg","localized_name":"Battle Tested","name":"Battle Tested","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/17b31c6806dfada4119416937469c9dc30786538.jpg"},{"icon":"e34aa5e42dffb0fd58bbd390289291f7f5f36dbc.jpg","localized_name":"Legion","name":"Legion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/e34aa5e42dffb0fd58bbd390289291f7f5f36dbc.jpg"},{"icon":"4089b4d24e50c976be5bc7d3e2af5e8cd41b6269.jpg","localized_name":"Star of Paris","name":"Star of Paris","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4089b4d24e50c976be5bc7d3e2af5e8cd41b6269.jpg"},{"icon":"3cecfeeb08f490668e58e26475c77db0ebf07e19.jpg","localized_name":"Les Riches","name":"Les Riches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/3cecfeeb08f490668e58e26475c77db0ebf07e19.jpg"},{"icon":"4813cfc33eec50992233e6a102faa5b03dca36f3.jpg","localized_name":"Valorous","name":"Valorous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4813cfc33eec50992233e6a102faa5b03dca36f3.jpg"},{"icon":"2fa1105718a0246cc045ae03996178e776079bb8.jpg","localized_name":"Records of the Past","name":"Records of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/2fa1105718a0246cc045ae03996178e776079bb8.jpg"},{"icon":"866a845460ee09db8d65e1ff7cfad9becad3bb31.jpg","localized_name":"Treasure of the Scholar","name":"Treasure of the Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/866a845460ee09db8d65e1ff7cfad9becad3bb31.jpg"},{"icon":"4dfe023b9c21760ad8eb4805577bbc09a998a331.jpg","localized_name":"Mirabeau's Story","name":"Mirabeau's Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4dfe023b9c21760ad8eb4805577bbc09a998a331.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/994730?t=1775550268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775550268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/12a109ce00bdbc54be00639ed213f2829fde9d5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775550268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/12a109ce00bdbc54be00639ed213f2829fde9d5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775550268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Deck Verified</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/944be2dec4560f3e1b3d6f810d2a822a.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/e7e801cea60438b9ee572adca7d299eb.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/21e6afa01e797efc54a388d4452465fe.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inheriting the classic strategic gameplay from the golden era of Japanese tactical RPGs, you will personally command diverse military units that were active on European battlefields in the 18th and 19th centuries, including line infantry, skirmishers, cavalry, and artillery. Master the rock-paper-scissors of unit type advantages, leverage terrain to your benefit, and adapt to dynamic environmental changes like rainstorms, heavy snow, fog, and night\u2014conditions that can alter the fate of your entire army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/5abbb14099ad5ddef8136fc927c9b647.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/331d1df40b3ac0c0415bbdf69c72c16f.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An era of revolution breeds heroes: talented and reliable generals, members of secret organizations serving the crown, and musicians with extraordinary gifts... The game features over 30 beautifully illustrated characters from diverse backgrounds. The unique anime-inspired art style creates a striking contrast with the rich historical setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/c61fb39f66498376beec60a24cba7358.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/bcdb0e567781af2d6b9b7bc7b7b104e3.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/698077fdcf6640df38b61ff030559be0.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this turbulent period of the French Revolution, factions like the Royalists, the Feuillants, the Jacobins, and the Malmason circle vie for power in Paris. Based at the &quot;Malmason Salon,&quot; Pauline Bonaparte finds herself at the heart of political turmoil. She must engage with all factions in Paris, completing their entrusted missions and challenges, building connections with royalty and key political figures to earn their support, and securing funds to improve weaponry and supplies. Simultaneously, she must uncover the secrets of The Maid hidden deep within the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/e6dfac047445597a6878f56e51d5bcbb.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.poster.avif?t=1775550268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.webm?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/b77661848235fc37f86a3ada7584babb.mp4?t=1775550268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit commanders with diverse abilities. Each character boasts unique skills, growth potential, and personal stories waiting to be unlocked. By learning their pasts, you can grant them passive bonuses, customize their equipment, and nurture them through rich promotion paths into legendary commanders capable of turning the tide of battle. Assemble a steel legion that perfectly matches your tactical style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/a16e750973800686a446fbb00117ad44.avif?t=1775550268\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a pure, hardcore SRPG gameplay experience. Freely combine skills and unit types, master the advantages of unit matchups and terrain, and devise strategies on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 beautifully illustrated characters, each with distinct personalities and faction allegiances, make their appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the political landscape between major factions like the Royalists and the Jacobins. Complete their requests to earn prestige, funds, and rare military equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your commanders' skills, unlock the personal stories behind each character, and forge your steel legion through a deep, varied class promotion system.</p></li></ul>","developers":[